--- !u!114 &1870295258
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1870295256}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3811d5299b48e3e43a4c2383fffe0b8c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1136095212}
  characterNameText: {fileID: 864568499}
  dialogueAudioSource: {fileID: 1917352115}
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 45363629}
  shikiSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f671973af56c57c48abb287dddea2ac7, type: 3}
  makiSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 012169a26b7a0b74790b71a218e9272f, type: 3}
  dialogueSnippets:
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Wow, the stage is different when you\u2019re standing
      on it"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I\u2019ve been to a bunch of idol concerts, sure."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s not like there\u2019s much else to do in
      this place, and there have been even more than usual recently."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "You can\u2019t get away from it"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "But I\u2019ve never been actually on the stage."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Security just waved me right through.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: It looks so weird with no one here.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "The tech is incredible though, I can\u2019t deny that."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I wonder how\u2026)"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Blimey Maki, no time to even catch my breath! Better
      answer.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Are you psychic? I just got here
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I\u2019ve done the walk from our place to the stage
      five to six times a week since I was 12, I know how long it takes."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: I added three minutes as you know it less well.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Minus one as you were in a hurry.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026Fair."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: You ready?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I kinda have to be, don\u2019t I? "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " Yes! Let\u2019s get started"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'OK, Shiki! So, as you know, idol concerts on our ship
      are a sound and light extravaganza!! '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Fortunately for you, the flying lights aren\u2019t
      just fun for the audience to look at, they tell you when to move!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: OK... But which lights and which moves??
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I\u2019ll break it down. Let\u2019s do your left hand
      first."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Left is pink right?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Left is pink. You read the handbook at least.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'OK Shiki, I want you to point at the pink triangles
      to the beat. | '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Just point?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Just point.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'If you really <i> feel </i> the rhythm it will be a
      vibe, trust me. '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'OK, for those of us with slightly less rhythm in our
      bodies, when do you point? '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: When the triangle and its spinning outline overlap.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Which is also the moment they reach the screen.  Which
      is also on beat.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " It\u2019s really not that hard"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Easy for you to say\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: What was that?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Nothing, let\u2019s try it."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Finally! OK, I\u2019ll turn on some music."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Point at the triangles with your left hand, Shiki!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Let\u2019s go."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "OK, that wasn\u2019t that bad!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s fun right? OK let\u2019s add the right hand."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: ' Already? '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " Well I trained for five years, you have five hours
      until you debut, so\u2026 "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Point taken.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s just the same thing. "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Pink for left, blue for right. Hit the triangles to
      the beat\u2014"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: At the moment they overlap, which is also the moment
      they reach the blue frame on my screen.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: ' A pro!'
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I wish. Let\u2019s just give it a go"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " I think I\u2019m getting the hang of it! "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "You\u2019re doing great! But it\u2019s about to get
      a bit more complicated."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Both hands?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Both hands.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " When we point at the same time, it\u2019s for the
      idol\u2019s symbol. Mine is\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " When we point at the same time, it\u2019s for the
      idol\u2019s symbol. Mine is\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: A panda.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026 "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Maki\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Of course, seeing as the switch was a last minute thing,
      we don\u2019t have a symbol for you."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "So for now, you\u2019re going to be a panda too."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Sis, are you sure you\u2019re OK with this?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Well\u2026 It was you who gave me that panda so\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Anyway, this isn\u2019t a big step up. "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Basically, for the pandas, you just point both hands
      at the same time.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Got it.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "OK. Let\u2019s add that in."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I won\u2019t let you down."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: ' I know.'
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: How was that?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  currentSnippetIndex: 0
  isTesting: 0
